Now we substitute $\blueD{y=\sqrt{10-x}}$ and $\goldD{\dfrac{dy}{dx}=-\dfrac{1}{2\sqrt{10-x}}}$ into the equation:

$\begin{align}
\goldD{\dfrac{dy}{dx}}&=-\dfrac{x}{\blueD{y}}
\\\\
\goldD{-\dfrac{1}{2\sqrt{10-x}}}&\stackrel{?}{=}-\dfrac{x}{\blueD{\sqrt{10-x}}}
\\\\
-\dfrac12&\neq -x
\end{align}$

We did not obtain equivalent expressions on each side.
